                                "sense_id": "47a3f32c-6649-3847-a1e9-bd8c841f82eb",
                                "text": "Ein Unrechtsstaat, der täglich zehntausende Morde begeht, berechtigt jedermann zur Notwehr gemäß § 53 StGB.",
                                "translation": "Everyone is entitled to self-defense pursuant to § 53 StGB against an unjust state that commits tens of thousands of murders every day.",
                                "english": "Everyone is entitled to self-defense pursuant to § 53 StGB against an unjust state that commits tens of thousands of murders every day."
                            }
                        ]
